00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:50.537
It doesn't work

00:02:50.537 --> 00:02:51.838
all the time in an election.

00:02:51.838 --> 00:02:52.572
And it's time,

00:02:52.572 --> 00:02:53.806
I think, as a Republican

00:02:53.806 --> 00:02:55.175
to say leaders have to start

00:02:55.175 --> 00:02:57.043
actually putting some optimism out there

00:02:57.043 --> 00:02:58.545
